	"Author": "tlitookilakin",
	"TagLine": "A coremod for my other mods. Mostly shared code for those mods.",
	"Description": "AeroCore is a coremod used by some of my other mods. Mostly, it's just code, but there are a few features available to users:\n\n- Cursor Light: A small, square light that lights up the tile you're currently hovering over. Press a configurable hotkey to turn it on and off.\n- Place item in world: Press a configurable hotkey to place the currently held item on the floor.\n- More lighting quality options: Adds two new higher-quality options for lighting quality.\n- Lighting flicker fix: reduces flickering and artifacts from high-detail lighting.\n\nOptions can be configured via GMCM.",
